      "output": "def Conjecture283.factor : \u2115 \u2192 \u211d :=\nfun n => Real.cos (Real.pi / (\u2191n + 3))\ndef Conjecture283.prefix : \u2115 \u2192 \u211d :=\nfun n => \u220f k \u2208 Finset.range n, Conjecture283.factor k\ndef Conjecture283.constant : \u211d :=\n\u220f' (n : \u2115), Conjecture283.factor n\ndef Conjecture283.partialProduct : \u2115 \u2192 \u211d :=\nfun N => \u220f k \u2208 Finset.Icc 3 N, Real.cos (Real.pi / \u2191k)\ndef Conjecture283.CubicConvergence : Prop :=\n(fun N => Conjecture283.partialProduct N - Conjecture283.constant) =O[Filter.atTop] fun N => (\u2191N ^ 3)\u207b\u00b9\nConjecture283.factor_pos (n : \u2115) : 0 < Conjecture283.factor n\n'Conjecture283.factor_pos' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.factor_le_one (n : \u2115) : Conjecture283.factor n \u2264 1\n'Conjecture283.factor_le_one' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.factor_deficit_nonneg (n : \u2115) : 0 \u2264 1 - Conjecture283.factor n\n'Conjecture283.factor_deficit_nonneg' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.factor_deficit_lower (n : \u2115) : 2 / (\u2191n + 3) ^ 2 \u2264 1 - Conjecture283.factor n\n'Conjecture283.factor_deficit_lower' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.factor_deficit_upper (n : \u2115) : 1 - Conjecture283.factor n \u2264 Real.pi ^ 2 / 2 / (\u2191n + 3) ^ 2\n'Conjecture283.factor_deficit_upper' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.summable_factor_sub_one : Summable fun n => Conjecture283.factor n - 1\n'Conjecture283.summable_factor_sub_one' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.summable_log_factor : Summable fun n => Real.log (Conjecture283.factor n)\n'Conjecture283.summable_log_factor' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.constant_eq_exp_logSum : Conjecture283.constant = Real.exp (\u2211' (n : \u2115), Real.log (Conjecture283.factor n))\n'Conjecture283.constant_eq_exp_logSum' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.constant_pos : 0 < Conjecture283.constant\n'Conjecture283.constant_pos' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.hasProd_factor : HasProd Conjecture283.factor Conjecture283.constant\n'Conjecture283.hasProd_factor' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.tendsto_prefix : Filter.Tendsto Conjecture283.prefix Filter.atTop (nhds Conjecture283.constant)\n'Conjecture283.tendsto_prefix' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.prefix_succ (n : \u2115) : Conjecture283.prefix (n + 1) = Conjecture283.prefix n * Conjecture283.factor n\n'Conjecture283.prefix_succ' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.prefix_pos (n : \u2115) : 0 < Conjecture283.prefix n\n'Conjecture283.prefix_pos' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.prefix_antitone : Antitone Conjecture283.prefix\n'Conjecture283.prefix_antitone' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.constant_le_prefix (n : \u2115) : Conjecture283.constant \u2264 Conjecture283.prefix n\n'Conjecture283.constant_le_prefix' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.partialProduct_add_two (n : \u2115) : Conjecture283.partialProduct (n + 2) = Conjecture283.prefix n\n'Conjecture283.partialProduct_add_two' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.tendsto_partialProduct :\n  Filter.Tendsto Conjecture283.partialProduct Filter.atTop (nhds Conjecture283.constant)\n'Conjecture283.tendsto_partialProduct' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.prefix_error_lower (n : \u2115) :\n  2 * Conjecture283.constant / (\u2191n + 3) ^ 2 \u2264 Conjecture283.prefix n - Conjecture283.constant\n'Conjecture283.prefix_error_lower' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.error_lower (N : \u2115) (hN : 3 \u2264 N) :\n  2 * Conjecture283.constant / (\u2191N + 1) ^ 2 \u2264 Conjecture283.partialProduct N - Conjecture283.constant\n'Conjecture283.error_lower' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.cubic_scaled_unbounded_of_lower (e : \u2115 \u2192 \u211d) (K : \u211d) (hK : 0 < K)\n  (hlower : \u2200 (N : \u2115), 3 \u2264 N \u2192 2 * K / (\u2191N + 1) ^ 2 \u2264 e N) (C : \u211d) (N\u2080 : \u2115) : \u2203 N, N\u2080 \u2264 N \u2227 C < \u2191N ^ 3 * |e N|\n'Conjecture283.cubic_scaled_unbounded_of_lower' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.not_cubic_bigO_of_lower (e : \u2115 \u2192 \u211d) (K : \u211d) (hK : 0 < K)\n  (hlower : \u2200 (N : \u2115), 3 \u2264 N \u2192 2 * K / (\u2191N + 1) ^ 2 \u2264 e N) : \u00ace =O[Filter.atTop] fun N => (\u2191N ^ 3)\u207b\u00b9\n'Conjecture283.not_cubic_bigO_of_lower' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.cubic_scaled_error_unbounded (C : \u211d) (N\u2080 : \u2115) :\n  \u2203 N, N\u2080 \u2264 N \u2227 C < \u2191N ^ 3 * |Conjecture283.partialProduct N - Conjecture283.constant|\n'Conjecture283.cubic_scaled_error_unbounded' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.cubic_bound_counterexample (C : \u211d) (N\u2080 : \u2115) :\n  \u2203 N, max N\u2080 3 \u2264 N \u2227 C / \u2191N ^ 3 < |Conjecture283.partialProduct N - Conjecture283.constant|\n'Conjecture283.cubic_bound_counterexample' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.not_cubic_convergence : \u00acConjecture283.CubicConvergence\n'Conjecture283.not_cubic_convergence' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nConjecture283.conjecture_283 : \u00acConjecture283.CubicConvergence\n'Conjecture283.conjecture_283' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n"
